BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.15 Tm (LLC reports hundreds of deals from direct mail alone. Matt puts residential, commercial and multifamily) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.92 Tm (response at 0.5-1% and vacant land at 2-5%, so 2,000 letters at 1% yields 20 owners. The secret is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 289.70 Tm (consistency: do not quit after 200 letters [hemWETr8VGg @ 00:01:14]. Maximilian Dier runs the same math) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 274.47 Tm (on phones. Usually 1,000 calls produce one lead and 30 leads produce one deal, so the play is to pull) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 259.25 Tm (10,000 records, call each three times, and treat skip-trace quality as critical [KmEcpx-t8YM @ 00:01:55].) Tj ET
