BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (same logic as owner-builders: they got such a good price and saw enough money in logs that they skipped) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (the perc test, then hit rock big enough that the inspector ruled the site unsuitable for any septic system, a) Tj ET
